# Helm installation export

This directory contains Helm commands and the complete installer-supplied overrides for each chart. Chart defaults are not included.

Review every values file before committing this directory. User-provided values are included as supplied; arbitrary secrets are not automatically detected or sanitized. Only the explicit environment references below replace credential values.

## Before running

Follow the Helm installation documentation to complete the prerequisite steps. This export contains only Helm commands and values files; it does not perform prerequisite setup.

{{if .SkipDatabaseSetup -}}
Generated with `--skip-database-setup`: the values expect your configured database.
{{else -}}
The values include the bundled database's certificate authentication settings. This export does not provision the database.
{{end}}
{{if .Secrets -}}
## Environment references

Supply these variables before running `install.sh`. The script binds them with Helm `--set-file` using temporary private files; Helm does not expand placeholders in YAML.

{{range .Secrets -}}
- `{{.Environment}}`: release `{{.Release}}`, value `{{.Path}}`.
{{end}}
{{end -}}
## Apply

```sh
sh ./install.sh
```

Commands run in installation order and use the current Helm/Kubernetes context. Re-running them upgrades the same releases. Previewing this directory did not check the cluster or calculate a resource diff.
